    <briefdescription>
<para>Base YoY inflation cap/floor engine. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class doesn&apos;t know yet what sort of vol it is. The inflation index must be linked to a yoy inflation term structure. This provides the curves, hence the call uses a shared_ptr&lt;&gt; not a handle&lt;&gt; to the index. </para>    </detaileddescription>
